msgid "battleHints/wtOvertime_boss"
msgstr "Clear all Generators!"

msgid "battleHints/wtOvertime_header"
msgstr "OVERTIME"

msgid "battleHints/wtOvertime_hunters"
msgstr "Capture any Generator!"

msgid "battleTimer/overtime/messageText"
msgstr "Overtime!"

msgid "battleTimer/timeRemaining/boss/messageText"
msgstr "Time is on your side!"

msgid "battleTimer/timeRemaining/hunter/messageText"
msgstr "Time is running out!"

msgid "botNames/Ermelinda"
msgstr "Ermelinda"

msgid "efficiencyRibbons/damageCircuitOverload"
msgstr "Damage by Short Circuit"

msgid "efficiencyRibbons/damageHyperion"
msgstr "Damage by Hyperion"

msgid "hunterRespawn/hintText"
msgstr "Select a respawn point, or one will be selected for you automatically"

msgid "hunterRespawn/timerText"
msgstr "Time to return to battle..."

msgid "loading/boss/hint1"
msgstr ""
"1. Survive the battle for as long as possible. If the Harriers do not manage"
" to destroy you, you win."

msgid "loading/boss/hint2"
msgstr ""
"2. Take out enemies to remove their Plasma Charges and their bonus to "
"firepower. Go for the mightiest opponent first!"

msgid "loading/boss/hint3"
msgstr ""
"3. Charge your Hyperion superweapon by causing damage to Harriers. Fire it "
"to cause massive damage in a large area."

msgid "loading/boss/hint4"
msgstr ""
"4. You will be supported by Ermelinda herself. She can temporarily block "
"Generators, while her energy aura grants you and Sentinels faster reloading "
"and enough energy for your disabled EMP abilities."

msgid "loading/hunter/hint1"
msgstr ""
"1. Destroy the Blitzträger before the time runs out! Overload Generators to "
"temporarily bring down its shield."

msgid "loading/hunter/hint2"
msgstr ""
"2. With each Generator overloaded, Harriers collect Plasma to gain a "
"considerable bonus to firepower. The bonus is reset on destruction."

msgid "loading/hunter/hint3"
msgstr ""
"3. Beware the powerful superweapon \"Hyperion\". The Blitzträger charges it "
"by causing damage to Harriers."

msgid "loading/hunter/hint4"
msgstr ""
"4. Beware of sudden interference by Ermelinda's new tank. She can "
"temporarily block Generators, give boosting energy to her allies, and use "
"Blitzträger technology."

msgid "minimap/respawnEntry/hintText"
msgstr "You will start here"

msgid "pbt/defeat/1/1"
msgstr "The old man lost today. The Electric Intelligence did not."

msgid "pbt/defeat/2/3"
msgstr "Out of time, out of options. As expected. Try again."

msgid "pbt/victory/1/3"
msgstr "The clock says your time is up, Harriers. So does evolution."

msgid "pbt/victory/2/1"
msgstr "Harriers, you win. The Electric Intelligence thanks you."

